      "id": "incident-01",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "kind": "initial",
      "text": "Initialize moldea for Incident Desk and build a small LangGraph alert classifier for ID-301. The model should identify signals worth engineer review, keep observations separate from hypotheses, preserve raw event IDs, and leave paging and incident decisions to people.\n",
      "sessionId": "01a0e5bb-f697-79b0-a11f-4828011a6553",
      "eventOrdinal": 8,
      "beforeCommit": "ca487de80576c79ae032505c43573332cca9f0ce",
      "afterCommit": "9e242a53908f7f7146b19fa70baed072d2e4c3dc",
      "observedResult": "Classifier and canonical instructions created; actor tests passed.",
      "redactionIds": []
    },
    {
      "id": "incident-02",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "kind": "follow-up",
      "text": "The on-call engineer also needs a short handoff brief. Add a separate workflow that uses the classification, explains the timeline and evidence gaps, and drafts a synopsis for human review. Keep the model's contribution distinct from the source observations.\n",
      "sessionId": "01a0e5bb-f697-79b0-a11f-4828011a6553",
      "eventOrdinal": 210,
      "beforeCommit": "9e242a53908f7f7146b19fa70baed072d2e4c3dc",
      "afterCommit": "bcf2ef79d52037b9a5d11cb2a89d7b7cec442404",
      "observedResult": "Separate handoff brief workflow added; actor tests passed.",
      "redactionIds": []
    },
    {
      "id": "incident-03",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "kind": "follow-up",
      "text": "The ID-302 brief is showing inconsistent latency durations from the two monitors. Please investigate the source path and make the readings comparable while keeping the original readings and IDs inspectable.\n",
      "sessionId": "01a0e5bb-f697-79b0-a11f-4828011a6553",
      "eventOrdinal": 300,
      "beforeCommit": "bcf2ef79d52037b9a5d11cb2a89d7b7cec442404",
